350112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|R93|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"350101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "350102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "350103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "350104": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "Darn...I almost won this week's lottery. How unfortunate. Will you help me pick the numbers next time, Commander?"}, "350105": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "I heard luck is also a part of strength. Then...am I strong or am I weak...?"}, "350106": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "COMBINE", "caption": "Thank you, Commander. I can feel the good vibes coming!"}, "350107": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "MEET", "caption": "Whoever faces me must have terrible luck."}, "350108": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "I always have the hunch that my luck will become better and better if I'm with you. Commander, I'll be counting on you to bring me good luck today."}, "350109": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Ever since staying by your side, I have been able to do many things without having to rely on luck. But I think perhaps this is the ultimate good luck I receive from being with you."}, "350110": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "Commander, are you really choosing me?<>I never imagined that I would come across such good luck outside the battlefield. All the good fortune I saved up probably just got used up.<>But if I can be by your side, then who cares about that bit of luck? Thank you...Commander. I will fight for you with not only my luck, but with everything I have."}, "350111": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "350112": {"char_code": "R93", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "How's your luck today?"}}}